Package: devforge
Title: Development tooling for the bixverse family of R packages
Version: 0.0.6
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Gregor", 
        family = "Lueg", 
        email = "gregorlueg@me.com", 
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    Dev-time tooling, not a runtime dependency. Generates the parameter wrapper
    constructors and their paired checkmate extensions from a declarative spec,
    and lints the things the house style asks for but cannot enforce: roxygen
    that has drifted away from the formals it documents, function inputs that
    never reach a checkmate assertion, and rextendr bindings without an R
    wrapper.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    checkmate,
    purrr,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    quarto,
    tinytest
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/GregorLueg/devforge
